# Frontend env (optional)
#
# In the unified setup (one server serves website + API) you do NOT need this —
# the app calls the API on the same origin (/api/...).
#
# Only set this if you run the frontend on a DIFFERENT origin than the API
# (e.g. a separate static host pointing at a remote API):
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-domain.com
